<title>USA: Xylan names Bartos CFO.</title>
<headline>Xylan names Bartos CFO.</headline>
<dateline>CALABASAS, Calif 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Xylan Corp announced Dale Bartos has joined the company as its chief financial officer, effective immediately. Bartos was CFO at ADFlex Solutions Inc in Chandler, Ariz, until recently.</p>
<p>He also held CFO posts at Integral Peripherals and Micropolis Corp, and senior financial positions at Dataproducts Corp. and Harris Corp.</p>
<p>Xylan is a leading provider of high-bandwidth campus switching systems.  Its OmniSwitch and PizzaSwitch connect Ethernet, Token Ring, FDDI, CDDI, Fast Ethernet, ATM and frame relay, at wire speed, with automatic any-to-any translation.</p>
</text>
